hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"146","[AI-translation] Allah ki panah mange; shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah ka iqrar kare. [Waswase par kare]"
"147","[AI-translation] Jis cheez mein shak ho use chhod de. [Waswase par]"
"148","[AI-translation] Allah aur us ke rasulon par iman laya, kahe. Phir yeh aayat padhe: Wohi Awwal hai aur Aakhir hai, Zahir hai aur Batin hai; woh har cheez janne wala hai. [surah Al-Hadeed:3 – Waswase par padhe]"
